    art: 
    arrival: 'Finn: Finn, cabin boy of the Lark, at your service! A room with water,
      if it''s no trouble.

      Ground floor''s best. And no posh types next door.
      They look at me funny.'
    story:
    - 'Finn[sad]: The Captain stayed with the ship. I couldn''t swim back to him.
      I''ve felt rotten ever since.'
    - 'Finn[happy]: Captain Morrow''s logbook says I was the bravest on board. ME!
      Imagine that.'
    checkout: 'Finn[happy]: Have my bosun''s whistle. Blow it and I''ll hear you,
      wherever I am.'
    keepsake: Bosun's Whistle
